{
  "title": "In order to receive notifications on your smartwatch from the app",
  "data": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. Open the \"Optimizer\" app on the desktop of your mobile phone, select \"App launch\" and click on it",
      "image": null,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. Find NoiseFit, if the switch is off, turn the switch on and then off;If the switch is on, set the switch to off, and in the \"Manual Management\" pop-up window, check the \"Auto-launch\", \"Secondary launch\" and \"Run in background\" boxes and click \"OK\".",
      "image": null,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "image": "https://images.gonoise.com/user-manual-guide/production/App+Update+SS/Huawei/auto-start/Optimizer/1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "image": "https://images.gonoise.com/user-manual-guide/production/App+Update+SS/Huawei/auto-start/Optimizer/2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "image": "https://images.gonoise.com/user-manual-guide/production/App+Update+SS/Huawei/auto-start/Optimizer/3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "If you are unable to set it up as described above, try the following steps.",
      "image": null,
      "bold": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. Open the system settings of the phone.",
      "image": null,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. Select \"Apps\" (or \"Apps&services\" for HarmonyOS) > \"App Launch\".",
      "image": null,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. Find NoiseFit, if the switch is off, turn the switch on and then off;If the switch is on, set the switch to off, and in the \"Manual Management\" pop-up window, check the \"Auto-launch\", \"Secondary launch\" and \"Run in background\" boxes and click \"OK\".",
      "image": null,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "image": "https://images.gonoise.com/user-manual-guide/production/App+Update+SS/Huawei/auto-start/Settings/1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "image": "https://images.gonoise.com/user-manual-guide/production/App+Update+SS/Huawei/auto-start/Settings/2.jpeg"
